{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "e18fa67bf1774b4d9e973c1b691ebe91a2ff848af568d8ed28277f57267ab2b8", "ja": "砂原にて", "zh": "在砂原", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "564883af07a8778cfe2b80e405bce716b24a63b88618b41bf9d5818b8c4b18d1", "ja": "サハラ砂漠で配信を行う琴葉、風花、\n瑞希、亜美。過酷な環境からか、話の筋が\nグダグダになっていく中、すぐさま\n軌道修正する琴葉の手腕が光る！", "zh": "琴叶、风花、瑞希和亚美在撒哈拉沙漠进行直播。也许是因为环境过于艰苦，话题逐渐变得乱七八糟之际，琴叶立刻把话题拉回正轨，尽显本领！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "101664f3fb114997261717b4a26d14009613cd35a4350b63f7d0c781bd7e6acb", "ja": "（琴葉たちとサハラ砂漠に来ている。\nもうじき配信開始だ。3、2、1……）", "zh": "（我和琴叶她们一起来到了撒哈拉沙漠。马上就要开始直播了。3、2、1……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "8fc15e09f6465f12b8bf7496233de1c8314211ffe606a4d92ea50b30632afaa1", "ja": "みなさんこんにちは！　今回の『765プロあどべん☆\nチャンネル』はサハラ砂漠よりお届けしています！", "zh": "大家好！这次的《765Pro冒险☆\n频道》是在撒哈拉沙漠为大家播出的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4b22901db23ace7316e2f03fadafcab8a62ccb698997ecb0eacc41657b2c8e0b", "ja": "とっても暑いんですけど、夜はすごく寒くなります。\nみんな、体調管理には気を付けようね……！", "zh": "虽然非常炎热，但到了晚上会变得特别寒冷。\n大家要注意身体状况哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "4499e6c48f9f2b45ea347a2af019e0f65138b16f91d6c873bc9741e3652a9896", "ja": "はい。体調管理、大事。\n命あっての物種……だぞ。", "zh": "嗯。身体状况管理很重要。\n有命才有一切……哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "e44e856870aeb8b249b89378025afe7702ae49cc8dd8cd8b4e07b7e04162f366", "ja": "みずきん、モノダネって何？　モノマネのこと？\n……らぶです。", "zh": "小瑞希，“物种”是什么？是模仿吗？\n……爱你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "e72aa0324c99bdad283e66c7593f61e735f84b05018c08489d85445ff988501e", "ja": "亜美さん、物種とモノマネは違います。でも、私の\nモノマネ、とっても似ています。……ぐっ。", "zh": "亚美小姐，物种和模仿是不一样的。不过，我的模仿非常像。……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f9d8e3ce20a90716361994ca61866ce85c0b300f5d9c2d0d0c6273c42b01138d", "ja": "（おや？　アドリブで台本からズレたな。\n方向修正した方が……）", "zh": "（哦？即兴发挥让她偏离剧本了啊。是不是该把方向纠正回来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "cdb50b094ac5b91106a966f1f382d260dfcfee494e8bf9f2e39ca99529ef9805", "ja": "と、ところで、サハラ砂漠の「サハラ」というのは、\n「砂漠」という意味だそうです。", "zh": "话、话说回来，撒哈拉沙漠中的“撒哈拉”，据说就是“沙漠”的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9d2a72b94bec1791aab8f40f46e14fa8306f73c2b66f5da6e6aebae07eb4f31f", "ja": "（っと、ちょっと強引だけど、琴葉が戻してくれた。\nありがとう、琴葉！）", "zh": "（虽然有点强行，不过琴叶把话题拉回来了。谢谢你，琴叶！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "4d1afa69454b8db842a13baa00cf0877c69c64a7e5a01c78b99c2e6eb133cb54", "ja": "じゃあ「砂漠砂漠」ってコト！？　ヘンテコっしょ！", "zh": "那就是“沙漠沙漠”咯！？很奇怪吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f14bb3c29516879baf1acf9d390bc511c1d93c1933f94cd379804d1ba8907baa", "ja": "ふふ、そうだね。さて、私たちの体力も\n限界なので、戻ります。それでは、また～！", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。那么，我们的体力也到极限了，该回去了。那就下次见啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bf3c981b8c0067ea46b2fd352f00bef62b2c06929963e99d90ce1a3f1f495895", "ja": "（ふぅ……過酷な環境だけど、みんなバッチリ\n笑顔を見せてくれた。これこそ765プロ魂！）", "zh": "（呼……虽然环境很恶劣，但大家还是展现出了完美的笑容。这才是765的专业精神！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
